 Release notes are listed newest first. English is followed by Simplified Chinese.
 Test releases are experimental and do not establish real-vehicle compatibility.
 
+## [v0.1.26-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R39 — projection input generation and playback presentation candidate.
+
+### English
+- Bind submitted UI metadata to its render generation, rejecting obsolete frames after ownership or geometry changes.
+- Use the same input confirmation for full-content projection; preserve unique microsecond PTS and resync local UI after invalidation.
+- Add real media elapsed and duration labels with progress-only texture updates and unknown-data handling.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 绑定画面渲染代际，屏幕所有权或尺寸变化后旧帧不能重新开放触控。
+- 全屏高清模式使用同一输入确认机制，保障微秒时间戳唯一并请求本地 UI 刷新。
+- 增加真实播放时间与总时长，仅更新进度区域，未知数据不伪造。
+
